/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 90 0 R
/T (In the past decade, talent acquisition has become increasingly technology-driven, evolving into a function measured by metrics such as time-to-fill and cost-per-hire. While these metrics provide valuable insight into efficiency, they often overlook the most important measure of all: the value a hire brings to the organization. As a result, the long-term impact of the hire, which has always been difficult to quantify, can become secondary to the speed and cost of making the actual hire.)
/E (In the past decade, talent acquisition has become increasingly technology-driven, evolving into a function measured by metrics such as time-to-fill and cost-per-hire. While these metrics provide valuable insight into efficiency, they often overlook the most important measure of all: the value a hire brings to the organization. As a result, the long-term impact of the hire, which has always been difficult to quantify, can become secondary to the speed and cost of making the actual hire.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
