145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 92 0 R
/T (Too often, recruiting has become transactional. If a candidate does not fit a particular role, the interaction usually ends once the recruiter deems that they are not beneficial to them in that instance. The candidate may also never hear from that recruiter again, even if they are in an active interview process. This is what differentiates good recruiters from transactional ones. A good recruiter maintains communications regardless and keeps the candidate informed, regardless of the type of feedback they receive from the hiring manager. AI may continue to make candidate data more accessible, but it cannot replace the personal relationships that make candidates willing to consider a new opportunity. Recruiters who fail to capitalize on their ability to be personal, responsive, and relationship-driven risk becoming replaceable by AI.)
/E (Too often, recruiting has become transactional. If a candidate does not fit a particular role, the interaction usually ends once the recruiter deems that they are not beneficial to them in that instance. The candidate may also never hear from that recruiter again, even if they are in an active interview process. This is what differentiates good recruiters from transactional ones. A good recruiter maintains communications regardless and keeps the candidate informed, regardless of the type of feedback they receive from the hiring manager. AI may continue to make candidate data more accessible, but it cannot replace the personal relationships that make candidates willing to consider a new opportunity. Recruiters who fail to capitalize on their ability to be personal, responsive, and relationship-driven risk becoming replaceable by AI.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
