/Title (In the past decade, talent acquisition has become increasingly technology-driven, evolving into a function measured by metrics such as time-to-fill and cost-per-hire. While these metrics provide valuable insight into efficiency, they often overlook the most important measure of all: the value a hire brings to the organization. As a result, the long-term impact of the hire, which has always been difficult to quantify, can become secondary to the speed and cost of making the actual hire.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 294 0 R
/Next 525 0 R
>>
