686 0 obj
<<
/Title (The best recruiters track candidates over long periods of time, keep up with their LinkedIn activity, and continuously update their database. Candidates need to be ready to make the move, but proactively building relationships and fostering those relationships overtime can result in effective long-term talent pipeline.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 670 0 R
/Prev 685 0 R
>>
endobj
687 0 obj
<<
/Title (from a highly ranked national firm with $40K more in base compensation, with a 2,000-hour requirement and a compensation structure where bonus eligibility started above target.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 629 0 R
/Prev 671 0 R
/Next 700 0 R
>>
endobj
688 0 obj
<<
/Title (At the smaller firm, the partner who she would work with walked her through his book of business, showed her which clients she would be taking over, and explained the matters she would be responsible for upon potential hire.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 629 0 R
/Prev 701 0 R
/Next 672 0 R
>>
endobj
